  "description": "Meet the Kago Cargo Electric Bike 2-Pack, a ready-to-ride pair of long-range cargo eBikes built for couples, families, shared commutes, everyday errands, and weekend adventures.\nEach Kago electric bike is equipped with a 52V 20Ah dual-battery system that delivers up to 120 miles of range, helping you ride farther with fewer charging stops. A 1200W peak motor with 80 Nm of torque provides confident acceleration and dependable climbing power, while each bike supports up to 350 lbs of payload.\nFor a smoother, more controlled ride, both Kago bikes feature a front suspension fork, 20\" × 3\" fat tires, and responsive 2-piston hydraulic disc brakes. Integrated safety lighting helps improve visibility during commutes and evening rides.\nWhether you need two matching cargo eBikes for the household, a practical pair for shared adventures, or a convenient alternative to short car trips, the Kago 2-Pack gives two riders long-range performance, useful cargo capacity, and everyday comfort in one complete bundle.",
